# ui-counter.ot - a tiny stateful native app
#
# This example intentionally uses only the D44-D47 surface: resources,
# supported text properties, one click event, containment, and show.

clicks is 0

create window into app
title of app is "Otter Counter"

create text box into display
text of display is "0"

create button into addButton
text of addButton is "Add one"

put display in app
put addButton in app

when addButton is clicked
    increase clicks
    text of display is clicks
.

show app
